  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nElected Officials - Elections - Benton County, Iowa - Elections - Benton County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n Benton County\n \nElections\n \n \n\n \n\n Contact Benton County Elections\n \n \n\n \n \nHome\n \nVote\n \n \nRegister to Vote\n \nAbsentee Voting\n \nMaps\n \nMilitary/Overseas Voting\n \nPrecincts\n \nVoter ID\n \n \n \nElections\n \n \nUpcoming Elections\n \nPast Elections\n \nSample Ballots\n \nPrecinct Election Officials\n \nTypes of Elections\n \n \n \nElected Officials\n \n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCounty\n \nCity\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n \n \n \nCandidates\n \nNews\n \nFAQ\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElected Officials\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElected Officials\n\n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCity\n \nCounty\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n\n \n\n \n\n \nFrom the White House to the Courthouse, we've compiled a list of elected officials who represent the citizens of Benton County, Iowa. View by category from any device using the links below.\n \n \n\n \nFederal Officials\n White House, U.S. Senate, and U.S. House\n \n \n\n \nState Representatives\n \nGovernor, State Officers, Senate, and House\n Visit the Iowa Legislature website to enter your address and find out which state representative and senator represent your district.\n \n \n\n \nCountywide Officials\n including Soil and Water and Agricultural Extension commissioners\n \n \n\n \nCity Representatives\n Mayor and Council members, plus City Clerks in each Benton County community\n \n \n\n \nSchool Board Representatives\n School board members along with district administration information\n \n \n\n \nTownship Representatives\n Trustees and clerks for each Benton County township\n \n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Benton County Courthouse\n\n Hayley Rippel, Auditor\n\n Auditor's Office, 2nd Floor\n\n P.O. Box 549\n\n 111 E. 4th Street\n\n Vinton, IA 52349\n\n Contact Us\n\n Accessibility\n \n \nOffice Hours\n\n 8:00AM to 4:30PM\n\n Monday - Friday\n \n \nPhone Numbers\n\n Office: (319) 472-2365\n\n Fax: (319) 472-3692\n\n \n \n\n \n\n Contact Benton County Elections\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \npowered by \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
}
